          {
            "title": "Match Runtime Failures",
            "id": 152093,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operazione e gestore sono abbinati correttamente?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>data[\"missing\"] → TypeError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operazione e gestore sono abbinati correttamente?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>data[\"missing\"] → TypeError</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sia <code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code> sia <code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Zero Handler",
            "id": 152094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il secondo gestore per un numero di ospiti pari a <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"bill.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / guests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use numbers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ZeroDivisionError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Add a guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add a guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il secondo gestore per un numero di ospiti pari a <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"bill.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / guests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use numbers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ZeroDivisionError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Add a guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add a guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>/</code>, seguito da <code>ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
